@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+---
+'@cashu/coco-core': minor
+---
+
+Add `offline` to `ops.send.prepare`. An offline send is prepared from the mint's stored keysets
+without contacting it, and succeeds only when held proofs exactly match the amount; otherwise it
+fails before reserving anything. Executing an exact-match send no longer refreshes mint data.
